Error [E0211]: `CellReadGuard<Int>` can't be copied
  --> local_cell_guards_are_linear_before_codegen.jet:5:15
    |
  5 |     copied :: ~guard
    |               ^^^^^^
 Why: A Cell guard owns one live dynamic loan; copying it would create two handles for the same loan
 Fix: Move it instead with the move marker `^` (`^guard`), or create a new guard after this one is dropped
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211
